+# Data Transformer
+
+This skill covers data transformation patterns.
+
+## Setup
+
+All transformation scripts are located at:
+/Users/john.doe/repos/internal-toolkit/skills/data-transformer/scripts/
+
+Copy them to your local machine before running.
+
+## Transformation rules
+
+- Coerce string numerics to int before storing
+- Null values must be replaced with domain defaults
+- Date strings must be normalised to ISO-8601 before persisting
+
+## Testing
+
+Run the unit tests in `tests/data_transformer/` before submitting.
